        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Math Solution Layout</title>\n    <script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n    <script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: \"Times New Roman\", SimSun, serif;\n            line-height: 1.8;\n            margin: 40px;\n            color: #5a2a2a;\n            font-size: 16px;\n        }\n        .line {\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\n        }\n        .indent {\n            margin-left: 220px;\n        }\n        .layout-container {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n            margin-top: 10px;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .left-col {\n            flex: 1;\n            padding-right: 20px;\n        }\n        .right-col {\n            width: 400px;\n            height: 250px;\n            border: 1px dashed #ccc;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n            background-color: #f9f9f9;\n            color: #888;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 10px;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"line\">\n        ◇ 令 $F(a) = \\ln a - \\frac{a-1}{a+1} ; F(1) = 0$\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"line indent\">\n        $F'(a) = \\frac{1}{a} - \\frac{2}{(a+1)^2} = \\frac{a^2+1}{a(a+1)^2} > 0$\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"line\">\n        $\\therefore F(a)$ 在 $(0, +\\infty)$ 上递增, $a=1$\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"line\">\n        (2)先画图分析:\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"layout-container\">\n        <div class=\"left-col\">\n            <div class=\"line\">\n                由(1)知, $f(x)$ 在 $(-\\infty, 0) \\searrow, (0, +\\infty) \\nearrow$;\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"line\">\n                $g(x)$ 在 $(0, 1) \\searrow, (1, +\\infty) \\nearrow$\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"line\">\n                要有三个交点则必是如右所示, 考场中可用零<br>\n                点存在定理说明一下, 两函数在 $(0, 1)$ 上有一<br>\n                个交点 $x_0$.\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"line\">\n                由题知:\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"line\">\n                $g(x_1) = g(x_0) = f(x_0) = f(x_2)$\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"right-col placeholder\">\n            [Diagram: right-aligned, showing two intersecting curves with a horizontal line y=b, and points x1, x0, x2 marked on the x-axis]\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"line\">\n        $e^{x_1} - x_1 = e^{x_0} - x_0 = x_0 - \\ln x_0 = x_2 - \\ln x_2 \\cdots *$\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"line\">\n        $x_1 < 0, 0 < x_0 < 1, x_2 > 1$\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"line\">\n        $e^{x_1} - x_1 = e^{\\ln x_0} - \\ln x_0 ; x_2 - \\ln x_2 = e^{x_0} - \\ln e^{x_0} , \\because e^{x_0} > 1$\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"line\">\n        即 $g(x_1) = g(\\ln x_0), x_1, \\ln x_0 < 0 \\Rightarrow x_1 = \\ln x_0$; 同理 $f(x_2) = f(e^{x_0}) \\Rightarrow x_2 = e^{x_0}$\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"line\">\n        $x_1 + x_2 = \\ln x_0 + e^{x_0} = 2x_0$ 由 $(*)$ 式可得。\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
